From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:24:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] STUDIO ST-EASY: Start a song card, one-line help +
 control card, redo, START always plays, cursor line, tab labels, Studio level

- studio_start.c: the Start card (style, mood, tempo, length, Shuffle, Make it!, Inspire me!, Templates) and
  studio_make_song (pure function of picks + seed); studio_compose_scale for the mood's key mode
- studio_help.c: tab_help one-liners on the bar, the SELECT+UP control card, tab labels, Studio level (bit 15 of
  studio_stats.lines, no new save tag)
- studio_play.c: START plays on every tab with its target named (Play song / Play from here / Stop); NOTES cursor line
- studio.c: redo journal in the scene scratch (GBA: tail of BakeSt, .bss unchanged), SELECT+A redo
- FILE: Redo and Studio level rows, scrolling list; LYRICS START moved to the tools (Fit this line), CHOIR START dropped
- tests: compose determinism, undo/redo round trip, START targets, help fits, cursor line, level; runner script studio_easy
Not run: PS1 and Dreamcast toolchains (core tests + GBA only so far).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
